[00:14.90]This hotel room says "No smokin'"
[00:14.90]酒店房里写着"禁止吸烟"
[00:18.08]She's outside with the door slid open
[00:18.08]她倚在门外 滑门轻掩
[00:21.36]T-shirt, nothin' underneath it
[00:21.36]宽松T恤，肌肤若现
[00:24.29]Sativa dancin' right off of her lips
[00:24.29]笑靥如花 灿若繁星
